<title>USA: Microlog names Richard Thompson CEO.</title>
<headline>Microlog names Richard Thompson CEO.</headline>
<dateline>GERMANTOWN, Md. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microlog Corp said on Friday that Richard Thompson, president and chief operating officer, has assumed the postion chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Thompson is dropping the title of chief operating officer, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Joe Lynn, the former chief executive and company's co-founder, has assumed the role of chief development officer, Microlog said.</p>
